body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/665\\n\\nDuplicate check: all-status searches found the completed schema-evolution owner pm-dijg and the closed boundary-hardening issue pm-rxqcp9, but no open item owns optional-id derivation and dry-run/structured-error ergonomics. This is a focused regression child of the shipped feature."
